adv-xeno-biomorph-death-monarch = {CAPITALIZE(THE($xeno))} lets out a horrifying screech that echoes throughout your mind, it seems like it's finally over... Or is it?
adv-xeno-charge-prepare = {CAPITALIZE(THE($xeno))} prepares to charge at {THE($target)}!
adv-xeno-charge-ram = {CAPITALIZE(THE($xeno))} rams {THE($target)}!
adv-xeno-heavy-claws = {CAPITALIZE(THE($xeno))} sends {THE($target)} flying with their heavy claws!
adv-xeno-sprinter-prepare = {CAPITALIZE(THE($xeno))} crouches, eyeing {THE($target)}...
adv-xeno-sprinter-leap = {CAPITALIZE(THE($xeno))} leaps at {THE($target)}!
adv-xeno-sprinter-knockdown = {CAPITALIZE(THE($xeno))} knocks down {THE($target)}!
adv-xeno-burrower-prepare = {CAPITALIZE(THE($xeno))} digs its legs into the floor...
adv-xeno-burrower-tunnel = {CAPITALIZE(THE($xeno))} tunnels towards {THE($target)}!
adv-xeno-burrower-erupt = {CAPITALIZE(THE($xeno))} erupts from underneath, and hits {THE($target)}!
adv-xeno-burrower-solid = {CAPITALIZE(THE($xeno))} hits something really solid!
adv-xeno-berserk-start = {CAPITALIZE(THE($xeno))} is filled with an intense and overwhelming rage!
adv-xeno-berserk-end = The blaze of rage inside {THE($xeno)} has run out.
