adv-xeno-preset-description = Alien larvae have crawled aboard through the vents. Hide, grow, build a hive and breed - or stop them before they do.
adv-xeno-briefing = Hiss! You are a larval alien. Hide and bide your time until you are ready to evolve.
adv-xeno-round-end-agent-name = xenomorph
adv-xeno-rule-announcement = Unidentified lifesigns detected coming aboard the station. Secure any exterior access, including ducting and ventilation.
adv-xeno-rule-announcement-sender = Lifesign Alert
adv-xeno-infestation-announcement = Bioscans indicate that Lizards have been breeding in {$location}. Clear them out, before this starts to affect productivity.
